MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

v2 changes, addressing the CF #4866 review of the same-named patch:
- callback named TableAmRoutine.reloptions (matches CF v5 naming)
- regression tests ship IN the patch (Mark Dilger's request):
  src/test/modules/tableam_reloptions — a heap-delegating test AM
  whose suite covers CREATE-time acceptance, unknown-key rejection,
  heap-key delegation, plain-heap rejection of AM keys, ALTER SET
  relcache re-parse, and SET ACCESS METHOD option-ownership transfer
- SGML docs (tableam.sgml, 'Table Access Method Relation Options')
- includes kept explicit (Japin Li's review point)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
